BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T000000
DTSTAMP:20260502T235433
CREATED:20251201T232551Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260502T145226Z
UID:10026315-1777755600-1777766400@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Virginia & the Slims | The Palm Room
DESCRIPTION:Virginia and the Slims bring an easy\, late-night jazz set to the Palm Room\, led by one of Asheville’s favorite local musicians. It’s relaxed\, swing-forward\, and built for hanging out. Nothing stiff\, nothing showy\, just really good players having a good night.\nGrab a cocktail\, find a seat\, or just drift in and out. The Palm Room does the rest.\n\n\n$10 cover both The Showroom and Palm Room music.\n  \nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/virginia-the-slims-the-showroom/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/671741769_18438863062191275_6390934475473989341_n-e1777733540297.jpg
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T000000
DTSTAMP:20260502T235433
CREATED:20260112T133214Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260429T110647Z
UID:10034757-1777755600-1777766400@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Andy Buckner – Live Country & Southern Rock
DESCRIPTION:Expect a packed night of honkytonk\, southern soul and cowboy grit from an artist creating serious buzz across North Carolina and beyond. \nBlending honkytonk & gritty cowboy seclusion\, Country artist Andy Buckner’s music embodies a balance of party anthems\, & instantly relatable heartache healers. Growing up on a Burley tobacco farm & cattle ranch deep in the Appalachian Mountains of North Carolina\, Andy spent his early childhood being a ranch hand while listening to gospel\, bluegrass\, southern rock\, & classic country music. There’s no doubt his cowboy lifestyle with horses & family rodeos\, mixed with influences such as Travis Tritt\, Hank Williams Jr.\, Waylon Jennings\, Lynyrd Skynyrd\, Gary Allan\, Charlie Daniels\, Keith Whitley\, Merle Haggard\, & Marty Stuart completely round out his southern soul approach. Andy’s grainy\, soulful voice\, embraces his North Carolina roots\, & shares authentic songs inspired by his upbringing. andybuckner.com \n  \nShamrock Irons Irish Pub – Asheville’s newest Irish Pub experience! We’re bringing back the fun with a fresh look\, perfect pours\, and the best live music downtown. Whether you’re a regular or a first-timer\, there’s always room for one more at Shamrock Irons. shamrockirons.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/andy-buckner-live/
LOCATION:Shamrock Irons Irish Pub\, 4 College St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/682146704_122134753593066278_3503697201183395872_n-e1777460796291.jpg
GEO:35.9844236;-80.0221361
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Shamrock Irons Irish Pub 4 College St Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=4 College St:geo:-80.0221361,35.9844236
END:VEVENT
