UID:10059358-1777813200-1777820400@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Brunchapalooza ft. The Groove Ridge Collective
DESCRIPTION:Sundays are for brunch. And Brunchapalooza takes it to the next level with live entertainment\, rotating themes and cuisines and your last chance to do it big before Monday. Each month we’ll be throwing on different costumes\, serving up fresh bevs\, supporting a different non-profit\, and devouring the rotating menu at the Let’s Cook food truck! \nMay the 4th be with you…tomorrow. Calling the orders of the Jedi & the Sith\, the Rebel Alliance & the Galactic Empire\, and everyone else in the galaxy! The premiere installment of Brunchapalooza is for you! Hop on your cruisers\, set your ships to lightspeed and get over to our place for an afternoon so good it’ll make it into the Jedi Temple Library. The Groove Ridge Collective takes the stage to keep the energy high and your space boots movin’. The “Mule’s Eisley Cantina” is all ages and free to attend\, so don’t leave the baby yodas behind!\nThis month’s beneficiary is Warriors of Ash\, so check out the specialty drink menu (N/A available too!) to support them.\nFollowing the band\, The Mirandalorian returns\, hosting another round of Star Wars Trivia starting around 4pm. If you’ve got the knowledge of the galaxy\, stick around for your chance to win some really great prizes!\n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/brunchapalooza-ft-the-groove-ridge-collective/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/670890228_18387228340090140_3525615510093247588_n-e1777297086497.jpg
GEO:35.5588369;-82.5218977
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages 131 Sweeten Creek Road Asheville NC 28803 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=131 Sweeten Creek Road:geo:-82.5218977,35.5588369
END:VEVENT
